/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pt
*.npz
/data
__pycache__/

# Raw self-play shards are hundreds of MB for a real run (3000 games ~ 427MB)
# and GitHub hard-rejects files over 100MB. Train locally right after
# generating, share only the trained weights (models/*.bin, tens of KB).
# The glob covers the staging directories used to hold shards out of an
# experiment without deleting them.
selfplay-data*/
